#@METADATA os=nixos-26
#===============================================================================
# nixos.init
# Base initialization sequence for NixOS nodes. Intentionally empty in CS-1.4:
# CS-1.6 adds the NixOS compat shims and the init lines. An init file with no
# action lines contributes nothing to HPS_INIT_SEQUENCE (node-libraries-init.sh
# _build_init_sequence) and does not break n_init_run.
#===============================================================================
